WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:17.507
White text reading "A person enters a kitchen" appears at the top left of a teal background. A yellow rectangular border sits at the bottom left. The text then disappears, leaving only the border on the teal screen.

2
00:00:33.471 --> 00:00:43.665
The yellow rectangular border moves from the left side toward the center, then continues rightward until it reaches the far right edge and stops. It remains stationary there.

3
00:00:54.363 --> 00:01:08.074
The text "Stir and serve" appears in the upper left while the yellow border stays at the right edge. The border then moves leftward across the teal background until it reaches the far left edge and stops. The text remains visible throughout.
